graph TD
    Marketer["Marketer<br/>(ST-001)"]
    Reviewer["Reviewer<br/>(ST-002)"]
    Admin["System Administrator<br/>(ST-003)"]

    System["Campaign Review & Approval System<br/>(this architecture's boundary)"]

