    Analytics["Analytics / Reporting<br/>(external, out of scope)"]

    Marketer -->|creates, submits, revises campaigns| System
    Reviewer -->|approves, rejects, requests changes| System
    Admin -->|configures roles & workflow| System

    System -->|authenticate / role claims| IdP
    System -->|lifecycle notifications, best-effort| Notify
    System -->|hands off approved campaigns| Sched
    System -.->|content references only, A-004| Assets
    System -.->|acknowledged at boundary only| Analytics

    classDef external fill:#eee,stroke:#999,color:#333;
    class IdP,Notify,Sched,Assets,Analytics external;
